      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "BODAK YELLOW (1) boasts a strong record this course with four wins and four minors from 12 tries. In the money last time at this track (22.73) in a Grade 5, finishing a neck third. Looks suited and should go close. REIKO BOOM (5) was below best last time when fifth but prior to that was a Grade 5 winner in quick time at this track. Has the ability and expected to do much better. OUR BENSON (3) is a capable type and proved too strong last time to win by 2.25 lengths at this track in a handy 22.57 beating Benny The Bull. Recorded one of the quickest times on the card in scoring last start. Can measure up again. COOL RUNNINGS (2) has ability and can feature with the right run after missing a cheque here most recently.",
